  <data key="d36">A spike in cross‑border incidents around the Russia–Ukraine front prompts NATO/partner navies to reassign ships and carrier strike groups to European waters and heightened patrols near the Black/ Baltic Seas, reducing the aggregate deployed assets and patrol intensity available for Middle East chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
