  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained attacks degrading Russian energy production and export capacity force importers to source incremental crude and products from Gulf producers, increasing volumes transiting Middle East chokepoints as shipments are rerouted to compensate for lost Russian exports.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
