<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::drone_capability" target="ai_governance::incident_frequency" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Wider operational use of long‑range unmanned strike systems accelerates deployment of embedded autonomy and remote-control software, increasing opportunities for malfunctions, misuse, and cyber exploitation that produce AI-related incidents.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_governance</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::drone_capability" target="global_finance_shift::oil_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved long‑range strike drone capability raises the probability of disruptive attacks on offshore platforms, tankers or remote facilities, increasing market supply risk premia and pushing crude prices higher.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_finance_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::drone_capability" target="middle_east_chokepoints::maritime_attack_freq" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved long‑range UAS operational experience and hardware from the Russia–Ukraine context are transferred (via arms sales, third‑party brokers, or imitation) to regional state and non‑state actors, enabling more frequent remote strikes and interdictions against commercial vessels and maritime infrastructure in chokepoint areas.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::drone_capability" target="tech_supply_divide::ai_development_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Accelerated deployment and demonstrated effectiveness of long‑range drones generate procurement and private‑sector demand for improved autonomy, perception and targeting models, directly accelerating AI development efforts focused on those capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
