  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened global energy price and supply stress raises the insured value and perceived exposure of shipments and terminal operations passing through chokepoints, driving up insurance costs and an observable risk premium embedded in oil and shipping prices.</data>
