  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid breakthroughs in frontier AI increase market expectations for medium-term productivity and growth (and associated inflation), leading investors to require higher long-term sovereign yields to compensate for anticipated higher real rates and inflation risk.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_governance</data>
  <data key="d39">global_finance_shift</data>
</edge>
