  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Accelerated frontier AI development shortens timelines for deployable maritime ISR and autonomous platforms, prompting states and coalitions to increase patrols and asset deployments to exploit or counter new capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_governance</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_chokepoints</data>
