  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster frontier AI development produces better perception, autonomy and sensor-fusion models that can be integrated into long‑range UAVs and loitering munitions, rapidly increasing their operational range, endurance and strike effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_governance</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
