  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rises in AI-related hacks, misuses and available offensive models enable actors to weaponize autonomous systems and cyber tools against ships and port systems, directly increasing hostile incidents at sea.</data>
