  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long‑term sovereign yields increase government debt service burdens and fiscal pressure, leading to budgetary constraints that delay rule‑making, reduce enforcement capacity, and blunt the scope/rigour of new AI regulatory initiatives.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_finance_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_governance</data>
</edge>
