  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long-term sovereign yields increase fiscal pressure and near‑term debt servicing costs, prompting some governments to defer naval deployments and maintenance, thereby reducing active maritime presence.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_finance_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
