  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long-term sovereign yields increase discount rates and debt-servicing costs for long‑lived data‑centre and GPU‑farm projects, directly reducing the financial viability and therefore new investment into AI infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
