  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising competition for limited compute capacity reallocates scarce secure, isolated testbeds and compute time away from safety evaluations toward commercial training runs, reducing the throughput of safety testing and remediation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">tech_supply_divide</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_governance</data>
